# Root-level cross-cutting ignores. Each of db/, etl/, web/ also carries its
# own .gitignore for concerns specific to that subproject (Postgres creds,
# the Python venv/downloaded bulk data, node_modules/.next) -- this file is
# just for things that could show up anywhere.

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor/IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Any stray env file at the repo root (subprojects keep their own .env
# out via their own .gitignore already; this is a catch-all in case one
# ever gets created here instead).
.env
.env.local
